## 7. THE DATABASE (14 tables)

Multi-tenant: every business table has a `tenant_id` column (nullable where cross-tenant entities exist).

### 7.1 tenants

Coordinator organisations. HelpHome is tenant #1.

| Column | Type | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| id | uuid PK | |
| name | text | "HelpHome" |
| slug | text unique | "helphome" |
| registered_provider | boolean | false until NDIS registration |
| created_at | timestamptz | |

### 7.2 users

Every login (client, worker, coordinator, admin).

| Column | Type | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| id | uuid PK | |
| tenant_id | uuid FK | NULL for admin |
| email | text unique | |
| password_hash | text | bcrypt hash; legacy plaintext "test" tolerated at login |
| entra_object_id | text | for MS365 SSO (future) |
| role | enum | client/worker/coordinator/admin |
| full_name | text | |
| mfa_enabled | boolean | |
| email_verified | boolean | gate enforced on `/api/login` (non-admin) |
| is_active | boolean | |
| created_at | timestamptz | |
| last_login | timestamptz | |

### 7.3 client_profiles

| Column | Notes |
|---|---|
| user_id, tenant_id | NULL tenant (clients belong to CareWork) |
| full_name, dob, address, phone | PII for commission reporting |
| ndis_number | |
| funding_stream | private / ndis / hcp |
| plan_manager_type | self_managed / plan_managed / ndia_managed |
| plan_manager_name | "PlanCare" etc |
| interests | jsonb string[] — drives matching |
| support_goals | jsonb string[] |

### 7.4 worker_profiles

| Column | Notes |
|---|---|
| user_id | FK to users |
| tenant_id | NULL = independent; set = coordinator roster |
| worker_type | independent / coordinator |
| abn | contractor tax number |
| bio, skills, interests | jsonb where array |
| hourly_rate | real |
| capacity_booked, capacity_total | caps at 85% |
| consent_to_display | boolean — privacy gate for marketplace |
| onboarding_completed | boolean — set true by `/api/worker-onboarding` |
| verification_status | pending / verified / rejected |
| rating_avg, total_bookings | |

> **Note:** `consent_to_display` and `onboarding_completed` are both required by `/api/interests` and `/api/login`. If either is missing at runtime, the endpoint 500s. See §11 for the "column does not exist" issue.

### 7.5 worker_documents

Police checks, WWCC, qualifications, insurance with issue/expiry dates.

### 7.6 job_postings

Coordinator-advertised shifts workers can accept.

### 7.7 shifts

The core marketplace/roster entity.

| Column | Notes |
|---|---|
| tenant_id | NULL for marketplace; set for roster |
| client_id, worker_id | |
| start_time, end_time | timestamptz |
| service_type | |
| status | requested / offered / accepted / in_progress / completed / declined / cancelled |
| declined_reason | never penalises worker |
| match_score | 0–100 |
| matched_on | jsonb string[] (shared interests) |

### 7.8 progress_notes

Legal evidence of service. Immutable once approved.

### 7.9 wellness_logs

Confidential check-ins. `audience` field: `worker` (load/supported/balance) or `client` (mood/goals/satisfaction).

### 7.10 welfare_chats

Coordinator follow-ups on flagged workers.

### 7.11 comms_events

Masked in-app calls/messages (schema only).

### 7.12 invoices

Contractor tax invoices + client invoices (schema only).

### 7.13 signup_leads

Register three-door intake. Dedup on (email, door).

| Column | Notes |
|---|---|
| door | client / worker / coordinator |
| name, email, org_name | |
| interests | jsonb |
| funding_stream, plan_manager_name | from client door |
| preferred_worker_id | FK to worker_profiles |

### 7.14 visualcare_sync_log

Audit of exchanges with VisualCare (schema only).

### 7.15 verification_tokens *(added in 1.1)*

Email verification and password reset tokens.

| Column | Notes |
|---|---|
| id | uuid PK |
| user_id | FK to users |
| token | sha256 hash of the raw token |
| purpose | `email_verify` / `password_reset` |
| expires_at | timestamptz |
| used_at | nullable — set when consumed |

### 7.16 login_attempts *(added in 1.1)*

Rate-limiting log for `/api/login`.

| Column | Notes |
|---|---|
| id | uuid PK |
| email | text |
| ip | text (nullable) |
| success | boolean |
| attempted_at | timestamptz |

