## 8. THE API (all endpoints)

Base URL: `https://helphome-api.lifewealth.workers.dev` (prod) or `http://localhost:8787` (local).

**Auth pattern:** every private endpoint reads the `x-user-id` header **or** a Bearer JWT (`Authorization: Bearer …`). Malformed UUID → 404 early (middleware). Missing header → 401. Wrong role → 403.

### 8.1 Public

| Method | Path | Returns |
|---|---|---|
| GET | `/` | `{message, version}` |
| GET | `/api/demo-accounts` | 5 demo accounts |
| POST | `/api/login` | `{ok, userId, role, workerContexts, token, needsOnboarding}` |
| POST | `/api/auth/register` | creates user + profile + verification token; also writes signup_leads |
| POST | `/api/auth/resend-verification` | re-issues an email verify token |
| POST | `/api/auth/forgot-password` | issues a password reset token (silent if unknown email) |
| POST | `/api/auth/reset-password` | consumes token, sets new bcrypt hash |
| GET | `/api/verify-email/:token` | marks `email_verified = true` |

### 8.2 Client

| Method | Path | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| GET | `/api/workers` | independent + consented + verified only |
| GET | `/api/interests` | distinct interests across displayed workers |
| GET | `/api/client-profile` | logged-in client |
| GET | `/api/bookings` | own shifts |
| POST | `/api/bookings` | creates offered shift |
| POST | `/api/wellness` | client check-in |

### 8.3 Worker

| Method | Path | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| GET | `/api/worker-hub` | returns contexts + marketplace + roster |
| POST | `/api/worker-hub/decision` | accept/decline marketplace shift |
| POST | `/api/worker-hub/flag-support` | creates welfare_chat |
| POST | `/api/worker-onboarding` | saves bio, rate, skills, interests, consent; sets `onboarding_completed = true` |
| GET | `/api/checkins` | last 4 worker check-ins |
| POST | `/api/checkins` | submit check-in |

### 8.4 Coordinator

| Method | Path | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| GET | `/api/roster` | 20 workers, tenant-scoped, batched |
| POST | `/api/roster/:id/welfare-chat` | schedule follow-up |
| GET | `/api/requests` | shifts for tenant |
| GET | `/api/verification` | worker verification queue |
| POST | `/api/verification/:id/toggle` | verify/revoke |

### 8.5 Admin

| Method | Path | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| GET | `/api/admin/kpis` | 6 KPI cards |
| GET | `/api/admin/alerts` | derived live from DB |
| POST | `/api/admin/alerts/:id/dismiss` | no-op (client-side only) |
| GET | `/api/admin/activity` | last 10 events |
| GET | `/api/admin/people` | counts for 3 categories |
| GET | `/api/admin/health` | 4 health bars |
| GET | `/api/requests` | all tenants |
| GET | `/api/roster` | all coordinator workers |
| GET | `/api/verification` | all worker profiles (≥ 32 in seed) |
| GET | `/api/verification/activity` | recent verify events |
| GET | `/api/verification/stats` | worker / shift / log counts |

### 8.6 Charts

| Method | Path | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| GET | `/api/charts/trend` | 7-day worker wellness average |
| GET | `/api/charts/status` | accepted/pending/declined |
| GET | `/api/charts/revenue` | **deliberate hardcoded** (Xero owns money) |

### 8.7 Dev-only (remove before public)

| Method | Path | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| GET | `/api/_test/db/counts` | row counts for smoke tests |
| POST | `/api/_test/cleanup` | deletes `@test.com` / `@example.com` users + children |
| POST | `/api/_test/complete-onboarding` | flips `onboarding_completed` + `consent_to_display` to true on all workers — lets smoke tests reach `/my-hub` |

