## 9. THE FRONTEND (all pages)

| Route | Role | Purpose |
|---|---|---|
| `/` | public | Home marketing |
| `/login` | public | 5 demo role buttons |
| `/register` | public | 3 doors + forms + success screens |
| `/verify-email` | public | Email verification landing |
| `/onboarding` | worker | **WorkerOnboarding.tsx** — bio / rate / skills / interests / consent |
| `/forgot-password` | public | Request reset email |
| `/reset-password` | public | Set new password |
| `/dashboard` | client | Workers, filters, booking, match % |
| `/wellness` | client | Mood/goals/satisfaction check-in |
| `/my-hub` | worker | Tabs: Marketplace / HelpHome Roster (only if dual) |
| `/coordinator` | coordinator + admin | 20-worker roster, filters, welfare chat, client requests |
| `/verification` | coordinator + admin | Verify queue with status + context filters |
| `/admin` | admin | KPI strip, 3 charts, alerts, people, activity |
| `/requests` | admin | All client requests with filters |

**Worker tab behaviour (verified by UI smoke T2/T3):**

- Independent worker (e.g. `mia.chen@worker.com`) → no tab switcher, single Marketplace view.
- Dual worker (e.g. `sarah.johnson@helphome-worker.com`) → 2 tabs: CareWork Marketplace + HelpHome Roster.
- The Roster tab lists shifts assigned by the coordinator, with client name, service, when, and status.

**Session model:**

- Login stores `helphome_logged_in`, `helphome_role`, `helphome_user_id`, `helphome_worker_contexts`, `helphome_token` in localStorage
- Every page has a session-expiry guard: fetch 401/404 → clears storage → navigates to `/login`
- BUILD_ID check: on app boot, if `helphome_build` doesn't match, session clears (forces re-login after deploy)
- `/api/login` returns `needsOnboarding: true` for workers with any incomplete profile → `Login.tsx` redirects to `/onboarding`

**Mobile:** hamburger menu at <768px viewport. Content max-width 1180px.

